 "text": "Hey! How's everything going? There are lot of great ones. Would you go for a short one that's kind of like story, or a longer one that pairs with a classroom topic? Then a podcast that tells funny animal stories could be perfect. Try Short History for Kids, it' only a few minutes and they do a short animal story at every turn. Mostly, yes. Short History is very carefully vetted. I' start with short one alone and see how she likes it. Then try it in the car with the family, that's often the magic moment. I hope so. Nine year olds' tastes really matter, so keep an ear on it. Short and positive reviews from parents are worth a lot more than long ones from strangers.",
